{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_adr_0163_engineering_splits_into_disciplines_and_shared_modules_and_structural_electrical_and_building_services_share_one_attribute_carrying_object_adr_0163", "label": "ADR-0163", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0163-engineering-splits-into-disciplines-and-shared-modules-and-structural-electrical-and-building-services-share-one-attribute-carrying-object.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Engineering lists Disciplines (Mechanical, Structural, Electrical, Building Services / HVAC, Manufacturing) then Modules (Calculations, Requirements, Verification, Documents, Evidence, Reference data); Calculations is one module with Calculators, the Calculation register and Packs and templates; the three new disciplines share one attribute-carrying DisciplineObject; the Cockpit leaves the documents area for a Start tab."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0163_engineering_splits_into_disciplines_and_shared_modules_and_structural_electrical_and_building_services_share_one_attribute_carrying_object_disciplines_are_domains_modules_are_shared_tools", "label": "Disciplines Are Engineering Domains; Modules Are Shared Tools Beneath", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0163-engineering-splits-into-disciplines-and-shared-modules-and-structural-electrical-and-building-services-share-one-attribute-carrying-object.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PO after v0.25.0: the tree mixed two kinds of thing \u2014 only Mechanical and Manufacturing are domains, the other five are tools any domain uses; Manufacturing stays a discipline because it will grow process capability and process improvement."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0163_engineering_splits_into_disciplines_and_shared_modules_and_structural_electrical_and_building_services_share_one_attribute_carrying_object_engineeringdisciplines", "label": "EngineeringDisciplines.Disciplines / Modules", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0163-engineering-splits-into-disciplines-and-shared-modules-and-structural-electrical-and-building-services-share-one-attribute-carrying-object.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ordered lists driving the Engineering tree and a project's Structure tab; navigator names '<category> discipline' and '<category> module'."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0163_engineering_splits_into_disciplines_and_shared_modules_and_structural_electrical_and_building_services_share_one_attribute_carrying_object_disciplineobject", "label": "DisciplineObject (IDisciplineObject)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0163-engineering-splits-into-disciplines-and-shared-modules-and-structural-electrical-and-building-services-share-one-attribute-carrying-object.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tempest.Core.EngineeringDomain \u2014 an ordinary engineering object (identifier, name, metadata, lifecycle, revisions, relationships, parent) carrying an attribute dictionary in its type state."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0163_engineering_splits_into_disciplines_and_shared_modules_and_structural_electrical_and_building_services_share_one_attribute_carrying_object_disciplinecatalogue", "label": "DisciplineCatalogue", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0163-engineering-splits-into-disciplines-and-shared-modules-and-structural-electrical-and-building-services-share-one-attribute-carrying-object.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tempest.Workspace.Disciplines \u2014 each Kind declares its attributes; adding a discipline or Kind is a catalogue entry, not a new subsystem."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0163_engineering_splits_into_disciplines_and_shared_modules_and_structural_electrical_and_building_services_share_one_attribute_carrying_object_disciplineworkspaceregistration", "label": "DisciplineWorkspaceRegistration", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0163-engineering-splits-into-disciplines-and-shared-modules-and-structural-electrical-and-building-services-share-one-attribute-carrying-object.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One registration wiring every catalogue discipline: explorer area per Kind, view and Properties provider per Kind, one shared handler set (Create, Rename, Edit, Delete with undo, Move, Request review, Approve, Release, Set attribute), RegisterRehydrators."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0163_engineering_splits_into_disciplines_and_shared_modules_and_structural_electrical_and_building_services_share_one_attribute_carrying_object_calculations_module", "label": "Calculations Module", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0163-engineering-splits-into-disciplines-and-shared-modules-and-structural-electrical-and-building-services-share-one-attribute-carrying-object.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One module whose node shows the project's calculation objects and whose children are Calculators, Calculation register (issued sheets, kept) and Packs and templates (formerly Engineering Assets) \u2014 ending calculation work living in three places."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0163_engineering_splits_into_disciplines_and_shared_modules_and_structural_electrical_and_building_services_share_one_attribute_carrying_object_structural_discipline", "label": "Structural Discipline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0163-engineering-splits-into-disciplines-and-shared-modules-and-structural-electrical-and-building-services-share-one-attribute-carrying-object.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kinds Member, Connection, Foundation, Load case; attributes such as Section, Material, Grade, Length (mm)."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0163_engineering_splits_into_disciplines_and_shared_modules_and_structural_electrical_and_building_services_share_one_attribute_carrying_object_electrical_discipline", "label": "Electrical Discipline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0163-engineering-splits-into-disciplines-and-shared-modules-and-structural-electrical-and-building-services-share-one-attribute-carrying-object.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kinds Distribution board, Circuit, Load, Cable; attributes such as Rating (A), Voltage (V), Size (mm\u00b2)."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0163_engineering_splits_into_disciplines_and_shared_modules_and_structural_electrical_and_building_services_share_one_attribute_carrying_object_building_services_hvac_discipline", "label": "Building Services / HVAC Discipline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0163-engineering-splits-into-disciplines-and-shared-modules-and-structural-electrical-and-building-services-share-one-attribute-carrying-object.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kinds System, Zone, Equipment, Ductwork / pipework run; attributes such as Floor area (m\u00b2), Design temperature (\u00b0C), Duty."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0163_engineering_splits_into_disciplines_and_shared_modules_and_structural_electrical_and_building_services_share_one_attribute_carrying_object_attributes_recorded_as_typed", "label": "Attribute Values Recorded Exactly as Typed, No Design-Code Logic", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0163-engineering-splits-into-disciplines-and-shared-modules-and-structural-electrical-and-buildi